382
01:25:02,620 --> 01:25:04,760
Está alterando su mente, tranquilízase, tranquila.

383
01:27:24,370 --> 01:27:27,310
Pucuna, ajo, yoy, kitan, chas, kichon.

384
01:27:32,100 --> 01:27:34,400
¡Iba, dada, mona, kie!

385
01:27:35,300 --> 01:27:55,830
¡Uku, pima, suya, chikai, kie!

386
01:27:56,330 --> 01:28:02,970
¡Mu, ikaima, mune, kie!

387
01:28:04,380 --> 01:28:07,360
¡Tuku, son, hoyo, agame, suya, chikai, kie!

388
01:28:07,980 --> 01:28:11,490
¡Nyoka, wagame, kutsuka, katsun!

389
01:28:12,130 --> 01:28:13,730
¡Kutsuka, katsun!

